#. ja: アラグの時砂
#. de: Handvoll[p] Zeitsand
#. fr: pincée de sable du temps
#. column 2: pinches of sands of time
#. column 8: Born of Allagan ingenuity, this peculiar sand is said to possess the power to turn back time. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
#. column 9: Sands of Time
msgctxt "Item:7577:0:0"
msgid "pinch of sands of time"
msgstr "щепотка песка времени"

#. de: Handvoll[p] Zeitsand
#. fr: pincées de sable du temps
#. column 0: pinch of sands of time
#. column 8: Born of Allagan ingenuity, this peculiar sand is said to possess the power to turn back time. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
#. column 9: Sands of Time
msgctxt "Item:7577:0:2"
msgid "pinches of sands of time"
msgstr "щепотки песка времени"

#. ja: 古代アラグ文明が編み出した時魔法の産物。失われた時を取り戻す力があるという。<br>かつて【武器／防具】の強化に用いられていたが、今や技術の進歩により必要とされていない
#. de: Ein Vermächtnis der Allager. Der Sand vermag es, die Zeit zurückzudrehen und Dinge in ihren ursprünglichen Zustand zu versetzen.<br>(Wurde zur Verstärkung von Ausrüstung benutzt, ist nun aber nicht mehr erforderlich.)
#. fr: Fruit de l'ingéniosité allagoise, ce sable unique permettrait de retrouver le temps perdu. De meilleures techniques ont été inventées depuis sa découverte, et plus personne ne l'utilise aujourd'hui pour renforcer des pièces d'armure.
#. column 0: pinch of sands of time
#. column 2: pinches of sands of time
#. column 9: Sands of Time
msgctxt "Item:7577:0:8"
msgid "Born of Allagan ingenuity, this peculiar sand is said to possess the power to turn back time. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete."
msgstr "Этот необычный песок, созданный благодаря изобретательности аллагов, якобы способен обращать время вспять. Но с развитием ремесленных технологий он утратил свою ценность."

