#. de: Entprojizierungskristall
#. fr: dissipateur de mirage
#. column 2: glamour dispellers
#. column 8: This black prism absorbs the magical lights woven upon a glamoured piece of equipment, thus dispelling the optical illusion. Be fairly warned that dyes and company crests are also removed in the process.
#. column 9: Glamour Dispeller
msgctxt "Item:7621:0:0"
msgid "glamour dispeller"
msgstr "порошок для снятия иллюзий"

#. de: Entprojizierungskristalle
