#. column 2: grade 5 glamour prisms (clothcraft)
#. column 8: This crystalline prism captures the likeness of a piece of equipment and projects it onto another object of comparable form and function.<br><br>[Can be exchanged with Calamity salvagers for all-purpose glamour prisms.]
#. column 9: Grade 5 Glamour Prism (Clothcraft)
msgctxt "Item:7661:0:0"
msgid "grade 5 glamour prism (clothcraft)"
msgstr "призма иллюзий V (ткацкое дело)"

