#. ja: ロウェナの手形:戦記
#. de: Rowena-Marke[p] „Strategie“
#. fr: avoir de Rowena (martial/poétique)
#. column 2: Rowena's tokens (soldiery)
#. column 8: A note of promise received from Rowena for the delivery of Allagan tomestones of soldiery or poetics. However, due to the House of Splendors changing its policies, it is now worth less than the paper on which it is scribed.
#. column 9: Rowena's Token (Soldiery)
msgctxt "Item:7811:0:0"
msgid "Rowena's token (soldiery)"
msgstr "жетон Ровены (военная история)"

#. de: Rowena-Marken[p] „Strategie“
#. fr: avoirs de Rowena (martiaux/poétiques)
#. column 0: Rowena's token (soldiery)
#. column 8: A note of promise received from Rowena for the delivery of Allagan tomestones of soldiery or poetics. However, due to the House of Splendors changing its policies, it is now worth less than the paper on which it is scribed.
#. column 9: Rowena's Token (Soldiery)
msgctxt "Item:7811:0:2"
msgid "Rowena's tokens (soldiery)"
msgstr "жетоны Ровены (военная история)"

#. ja: アラガントームストーン:戦記もしくは詩学を納品した証となる商人ロウェナの手形だった紙切れ。<br>引き換え期限が終了し、今や取引には利用できない
#. de: Von Rowena für die Abgabe Allagischer Steine der Strategie oder Poesie ausgegebene Bestätigungsmarke. Der Handel mit diesen Marken wurde beendet. Sie können daher nicht mehr eingetauscht werden.
#. fr: Cet avoir atteste que vous avez remis à Rowena des mémoquartz allagois martiaux ou poétiques. Il pouvait être échangé contre des équipements de grande qualité, mais n'est désormais plus valable.
#. column 0: Rowena's token (soldiery)
#. column 2: Rowena's tokens (soldiery)
#. column 9: Rowena's Token (Soldiery)
msgctxt "Item:7811:0:8"
msgid "A note of promise received from Rowena for the delivery of Allagan tomestones of soldiery or poetics. However, due to the House of Splendors changing its policies, it is now worth less than the paper on which it is scribed."
msgstr "Расписка, полученная от Ровены в обмен на аллаганские камни военной истории или поэзии. Дом ценностей изменил правила, и теперь эта бумажка стоит меньше, чем та, на которой написана."

