#. column 2: unidentified Allagan tomestones
#. column 8: Though they appear to be naught more than simple stones, Garlond Ironworks engineers insist they contain reams of invaluable information gathered by the lost Allagan Empire. However, this particular variety is not as highly sought as it once was, and may no longer be exchanged for other wares.
